# The condition is an intervening "if" (CR 603.4): true as the ability triggers and again as it resolves. On turn three nothing
# has been cast from Bot1's hand, so the trigger goes on the stack at the end step; in response Bot1 casts Swords to Plowshares
# from hand on Bot2's Ornithopter. The trigger now does nothing: no counter is put on the Wingsmith. On turn five, with nothing
# cast, it triggers again (the stack holds it) and the counter is put on.

